# Pressure rises when headspace shrinks
register lv2
seal v1 1000mL
add v1 N2 0.0037mol
measure v1 pressure
new
seal v2 750mL
add v2 N2 0.0037mol
measure v2 pressure
new
seal v3 500mL
add v3 N2 0.0037mol
measure v3 pressure
new
seal v4 250mL
add v4 N2 0.0037mol
measure v4 pressure
# Ideal rigid headspaces only; real pressure work requires rated apparatus.
